  "intro": [
    "We offer a complete range of insulators moulded from high grade polyester reinforced resins (DMC and SMC). Standoff insulators are made from DMC material in conical, octagonal, full cylindrical, cylindrical, full hex, round-hex and drum (Taiwan model) variants. Finger type and grip type insulators are also offered, made from standard SMC material.",
    "The 42 page catalogue adds single, three and four pole busbar supports, step insulators, supports for vertical bars, L supports, an adjustable busbar support, neutral base, insulators for horizontal bars, three phase connectors and DC clips."
  ],
  "features": [
    "DMC standoff insulators in seven variants",
    "SMC finger and grip type insulators",
    "Item code tables with insert thread and depth",
    "Tolerance chart by dimension",
    "Single, three and four pole busbar supports",
    "Step, grip, vertical bar and L supports; adjustable support; neutral base",
    "Three phase connectors and DC clip"
  ],
